docs\progress\logs\20260624-231323_execute-P003.log:3005:I’m noticing that the `TextLayoutService` currently clamps render offsets to the text length, which results in mention positions greater than 5 being capped at 5. I’m thinking we should adjust this by using the render length instead of the logical length. Another option could be to incorporate the raw `TextLayoutService`. Alternatively, I could use `painter.getPositionForOffset` directly in `_offsetForLocalPosition` and then utilize the mapper. That could provide a better solution!
