docs\progress\logs\20260625-005220_execute-P002.log:4294:I’m thinking about how the logical mapping on boundaries should preferably follow a specific segment. It seems that this approach makes it easier to allow a caret between the mention and the following text. Right now, a closed interval returns to the previous position, but typically, it should maintain the same logical offset. I’m curious to see how this can improve functionality!
